--- Authors' data processing (first sample) ---
  * Illumina Casava1.7 software used for basecalling.
  * Sequenced reads were trimmed for adaptor sequence, and masked for low-complexity or low-quality sequence, then mapped to hg19 genome using TopHat2 v2.0.11.
  * Read counts per gene were summarized using HTSeq
  * Genes with FPKM<1 in more than a half of the samples were excluded from the next steps
  * Genome_build: hg19
  * Supplementary_files_format_and_content: HTSeq files (.out) contains the count numbers sumarized per gene

