--- Authors' data processing (first sample) ---
  * Illumina Casava1.8 software was used for basecalling.
  * Sequenced reads were mapped to the hg19 reference genome and GencdeV7 reference transcriptome using Tophat 1.3.1with parameters : -g 1 -p 4 -r 150 --coverage-search --no-novel-indels --microexon-search -G GFFfile --solexa-quals hg19 FASTQFILE1 FASTQFILE2
  * Gene expression estimates: Counts were calculated using the BEDTools 2.12.0 function coverageBed with parameters: -abam BAMfilename -b BEDfilename
  * BAM files were sorted using the samtols 0.1.18 function: samtools sort -n
  * BAM files were converted to SAM format using the samtols 0.1.18 function: samtools view -h
  * SAM files were converted to MRF format using the RSEQtools 0.6 function: sam2mrf
  * Gene expression estimates in RPKM were calculated using the RseqTools function mrfQuantifier with parameters: INTERVALfile multipleOverlap MRFfile
  * Genome_build: GRCh37 (hg19)
  * Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Tab-delimited text files include gene expression estimates in RPKM (.rpkm) and COUNTS (.counts.txt) for each sample.

